# <type>(<scope>): <short summary>
#
# Type must be one of:
#   feat     - A new feature
#   fix      - A bug fix
#   docs     - Documentation only changes
#   style    - Code style changes (formatting, semicolons, etc.)
#   refactor - Code refactoring
#   perf     - Performance improvements
#   test     - Adding or correcting tests
#   chore    - Build process or auxiliary tool changes
#   ci       - CI configuration changes
#
# Scope is optional but recommended. Examples:
#   cli, config, coverage, complexity, merge, score, delta, report, cache, deps
#
# The summary should be in imperative mood and not end with a period.
#
# Example:
#   feat(report): add HTML output formatter
#
# BREAKING CHANGE: (if applicable)
#   Describe what breaks and how users should migrate.
